Secrets for the Tapo API and HomeNexus API key. These should be set in your environment variables or in a .env file. Do not commit your actual credentials to version control.
TAPO_EMAIL="your-email@example.com"
TAPO_PASSWORD="your-password"
HOMENEXUS_API_KEY="replace-me"
DATABASE_URL="file:/app/db-data/homenexus.db"
DATABASE_PATH="/app/db-data/homenexus.db"